        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-505.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-505-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH506-HYPER-DIM-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH507-BACK-EMF-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH508-FEMTO-JITTER-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH509-EXT-SAAT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH510-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-505-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-505.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-505.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH506-HYPER-DIM-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH507-BACK-EMF-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH508-FEMTO-JITTER-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH509-EXT-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH510-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-BEYOND-505-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-BEYOND-505-WIT.
